  "published": "2026-10-05T00:53:36.307Z",
  "releaseNotes": "## Version 10.5.5 - October 5, 2026\n\n  - **Improved:** Document Viewer:\n\n    - **Improved:** Made `slate` theme look more crisp. Increased toolbar icons contrast, removed unnecessary toolbar shadows,\n      used thin scrollbars to reduce clutter.\n\n    - **Added:** New theme named `white` which resembles Adobe Acrobat design language.\n\n    - **Added:** `DocumentViewer.LinkTarget` property, a value that specifies the `target` attribute for external links in the PDF document.\n      Possible values are `\"none\"`, `\"self\"`, `\"blank\"`, `\"parent\"`, `\"top\"` (case insensitive).\n      Default value is `\"blank\"` which means clicked links will be opened in new browser tab/window.\n      In older versions, links were opened in same window by default.\n\n    - **Added:** `DocumentViewer.UISizing` property, a value that specifies the UI sizing to use for the viewer.\n      Possible values are `\"normal\"`, `\"large\"` (case insensitive).",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "File manager control for integrating file browsing, upload & download features into your ASP.NET application or site (WebForms or MVC) rapidly.",
  "title": "ASP.NET File Manager and ASP.NET File Uploader",
